--[[
        HONCHO RUSH -- Honcho runs through the rooms like Rush

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/HonchoRush"))()

        The lights of your room flicker and he screams far away: hide. Honcho (HonchoSeek's kit, with Seek's animations
        made his) comes out of the floor in the oldest room loaded and runs through every room to the newest, the lights
        of each room flickering as he passes, the screen shaking as he nears. Not hidden where he sees you: his face, his
        scream, your death. At the end he sinks back into the floor.

        Only you see it. Run it again: a new one (the one before goes). Outside DOORS he runs along a line through you.
]]

